{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>男團MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）與女友李炘頤（Alina）拍拖9年，向來感情穩定，年初（2月）二人亦在社交平台公布訂婚好消息，Stanley成MIRROR第一位準人夫，並預計婚禮於年底舉行。今日（9日）Alina分享了過大禮的照片並寫下：「過左大禮就真係來啦～倒數啦～少少緊張又加點興奮。」從她分享的相中可見，枱上放滿了金器，單是龍鳳鈪就已經有6對，更有兩對是重量十足的流星錘龍鳳鈪，參茸海味及嫁女喜餅更排滿一地，排場十足。</p><figure><img alt=\"邱士縉（Stanley）與李炘頤（Alina）年初公布訂婚。(ig@alinaln_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260909/1174434412751228928910537.jpeg/wKIbMOciGVpj2C9QSmC9ELOB03c2g-1hnQJxWp0CcVo\"/><figcaption>邱士縉（Stanley）與李炘頤（Alina）年初公布訂婚。(ig@alinaln_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Stanley成MIRROR首位準人夫。(ig@alinaln_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260909/1174434410616197120854762.jpeg/QnTJp4t4a5WCtyGkTvNKSUYSGiqVHACDRhRC_kYUQv4\"/><figcaption>Stanley成MIRROR首位準人夫。(ig@alinaln_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"邱士縉與李炘頤的過大禮儀式。(ig@alinaln_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260909/1174434408669908992375602.jpeg/8wHXHXLOiaXEIlTySOOlIrouVWsIlD0EJduJTCXbiUw\"/><figcaption>邱士縉與李炘頤的過大禮儀式。(ig@alinaln_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"枱上放滿了金器，單是龍鳳鈪就已經有6對，更有兩對是重量十足的流星錘龍鳳鈪。(ig@alinaln_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260909/1174434406643929088127064.jpeg/KGlOacXSRwmOLJ4rgZzdjvR2y2c55GpE0-YWVNPmFlQ\"/><figcaption>枱上放滿了金器，單是龍鳳鈪就已經有6對，更有兩對是重量十足的流星錘龍鳳鈪。(ig@alinaln_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"參茸海味及嫁女喜餅更排滿一地，排場十足。(ig@alinaln_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260909/1174434404496314368903241.jpeg/gCDefnNTDHmugbACwGrQH3zl2z44LWG5nnLCop5ywqI\"/><figcaption>參茸海味及嫁女喜餅更排滿一地，排場十足。(ig@alinaln_)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T11:55:02.396240+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":409,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}